category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Hexagonal hierarchical geospatial indexing system (utilities)"
ldesc: "H3 is a geospatial indexing system using a hexagonal grid that can be
(approximately) subdivided into finer and finer hexagonal grids, combining the
benefits of a hexagonal grid with S2's hierarchical subdivisions."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/uber/h3/
license: Apache-2.0
